scripts

# Release artifacts committed back by semantic-release after every release
# (@semantic-release/git). The image needs neither, and leaving them in the
# context invalidates the COPY . . layer on every release cycle - forcing a
# full dotnet build/publish even when no source changed (measured: warm legs
# stuck at 5-6 min instead of pure cache pulls).
CHANGELOG.md
.github
